+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- T11: block 4 end to end on real-format files
+# (review of the block-4 integration, finding 1: tier_route, build_tier_table and e_guard.C3bAccess had never run
+# inside a real e_eval.Run on files in the formats of the c3b campaign.) The private c3b archive of T11 is written
+# by the runner's own code at this checkout, in a child process (one scripts/47 module object per process, RF-17):
+# scripts/46 cell_record and dump_public (the records), scripts/50 synthetic_state and c3b_site_table (the state and
+# the site table), scripts/49 c3b_tier with scripts/47 sp_status (the recorded n_d), scripts/50 archive and
+# write_manifest (the archive layout and MANIFEST.sha256). The single points are pw.x texts as build_c1 writes them.
+# the production hosts in draw order, typed from e_block4.PROD8 (which cites P:214; the plan itself was not read for
+# T11); case_t11 compares the tuple with e_block4.PROD8 and with the production list of the runner's state
+T11_HOSTS = ("m06", "m02", "m16", "m12", "m32", "m26", "m22", "m23")
+T11_EB = {"Sr": 140.0, "Cl": -110.0, "Cs": 16.0, "GA": 24.0}              # planted first-shell E_b offsets (meV)
